msgctxt "L_PAM_004"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_005"
msgid "Reactivate teleportals\n"
msgstr "Reactivar los teleportales\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_006"
msgid "Disable Cetan megaweapon\n"
msgstr "Desactivar la mega-arma Cetan\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_007"
msgid "Secure control room\n"
msgstr "Asegurar la sala de control\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_008"
msgid "Restore Dr. Caroll's personality\n"
msgstr "Restaurar personalidad del Dr. Caroll\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_009"
msgid "Escape from Cetan ship\n"
msgstr "Escapar de la nave Cetan\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_010"
msgid ""
"This will help us to get round the \n"
"ship quicker.\n"
msgstr ""
"Esto nos ayudará a recorrer la \n"
"nave más rápido.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_011"
msgid ""
"This antibody masking will protect us from \n"
"the automatic defenses.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este disfraz de anticuerpos nos protegerá \n"
"de las defensas automáticas.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_012"
msgid ""
"There's Dr. Caroll. Let's see if we can \n"
"reverse what was done to him.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahí está el Dr. Caroll. Veamos si podemos \n"
"arreglar lo que le hicieron.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_013"
msgid "We have to get out of here!\n"
msgstr "¡Tenemos que salir de aquí!\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_014"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Elvis ha muerto.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_015"
msgid "Dr. Caroll has been killed.\n"
msgstr "El Dr. Caroll ha muerto.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_016"
msgid "Cetan ship evacuation successful.\n"
msgstr "Evacuación de la nave Cetan exitosa.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_017"
msgid "Elvis has unlocked the door.\n"
msgstr "Elvis ha abierto la puerta.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_018"
msgid ""
"Here, take this gun and keep those Skedar \n"
"off my back while I'm working.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aquí. Coge este arma y mantén a los Skedar \n"
"alejados de mí mientras trabajo.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_019"
msgid "Antibody masking has been obtained.\n"
msgstr "Máscara de anticuerpos obtenida.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_020"
msgid "Cetan megaweapon has been disabled.\n"
msgstr "La mega-arma Cetan ha sido desactivada.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_021"
msgid "Control Room has been secured.\n"
msgstr "La Sala de Control ha sido asegurada.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_022"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's personality has been restored.\n"
msgstr "La personalidad del Dr. Caroll ha sido restaurada.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_023"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_024"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_025"
msgid "Backup disk\n"
msgstr "Disco de seguridad\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_026"
msgid "A backup disk\n"
msgstr "Un disco de seguridad\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_027"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_028"
msgid ""
"It looks like this could benefit from \n"
"a little bit of sabotage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parece que esto puede beneficiarnos para \n"
"un pequeño sabotaje.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_029"
msgid "Time to reactivate those teleportals.\n"
msgstr "Es hora de reactivar esos teleportales.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_030"
msgid "Teleportals have been reactivated.\n"
msgstr "Los teleportales han sido reactivados.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_031"
msgid "This doesn't seem normal. No one's around.\n"
msgstr "Esto no es normal. No hay nadie por aquí.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_032"
msgid "No signs of conflict. No spent ammo cases or bullet holes.\n"
msgstr "No hay señales de lucha. No hay casquillos o agujeros de bala.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_033"
msgid "But there ought to be a rear guard at least. It makes no sense.\n"
msgstr "Pero debería haber un guarda al menos. No tiene sentido.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_034"
msgid "There has to be someone farther inside. Cover me.\n"
msgstr "Debe haber alguien más adelante. Cúbreme.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_035"
msgid ""
"Here goes. I just hope dataDyne haven't done anything to prevent this...\n"
msgstr ""
"Allá vamos. Espero que dataDyne no haya hecho nada para prevenir esto...\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_036"
msgid "Virus detected.\n"
msgstr "Virus detectado.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_037"
msgid "Me and my big mouth.\n"
msgstr "¡Qué bocaza tengo!\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_038"
msgid ""
"Commencing countermeasures. Commenc..... *** ooOOoh!! *** eeEEe!! *** "
"aaAhh!! *** oOOoh!! *** aAArRrgghh!! *** YEEeeooOOOOOOowWWwlll!! ***\n"
msgstr ""
"Iniciando contramedidas. Inician.....*** ¡¡ooOOoh!! *** ¡¡eeEEe!! *** "
"¡¡aaAhh!! *** ¡¡oOOoh!! *** ¡¡aAArRrgghh!! *** ¡¡YEEeeooOOOOOOowWWwlll!! "
"***\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_039"
msgid "Dr. Caroll? Are you in control again? Can you stop the program?\n"
msgstr "¿Dr. Caroll? ¿Tiene el control de nuevo? ¿Puede detener el programa?\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_040"
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm back again, my dear. But the program has run far too long for me to"
" prevent it from completing. There is only one way out now.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sí, estoy de vuelta, cariño. Pero el programa ha estado en marcha demasiado "
"como para detenerlo completamente. Sólo existe una manera de acabar con "
"esto...\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_041"
msgid "What do you mean?\n"
msgstr "¿Qué quiere decir?\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_042"
msgid ""
"When the program has run, I will have control of a vastly powerful weapon. "
"It cannot be allowed to exist. So I must destroy the Cetan and, "
"unfortunately, myself along with it. I'm sorry, Joanna... There is no other "
"way and no time to discuss this. Go now - avoid the Skedar and you will have"
" time to escape. It has been an honor to work with you. Goodbye, Joanna "
"Dark.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cuando el programa haya acabado, tendré el control de un arma "
"devastadoramente poderosa. No puede permitirse mi existencia. Así que debo "
"destruir la nave Cetan y a mí mismo con ella. Lo siento, Joanna... No hay "
"otra manera, ni tiempo para discutirlo. Vete. Esquiva a los Skedar y tendrás"
" tiempo para escapar. Ha sido un honor trabajar contigo. Adiós, Joanna "
"Dark.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_043"
msgid "Cetan megaweapon has been disabled.\n"
msgstr "La mega-arma Cetan ha sido inutilizada.\n"

msgctxt "L_PAM_044"
msgid "Ammo wasted - unable to disable megaweapon.\n"
msgstr "Munición desperdiciada - incapaz de desactivar la mega-arma.\n"
